# a118.script -- A118: a file selector opened by a desk accessory while NEWDESK waits for a press (a117.script's geometry, 640x480).
# 200 Hz ticks after "[desk] desktop up".
# 1) Desk (20,9) -> "A118 probe" (40,59), click                   -> AC_OPEN -> the accessory calls fsel_input
# 2) to the C: icon (37,40), outside the selector; double-click     -> EmuTOS: the accessory owns the mouse, nothing reaches NEWDESK
# 3) Return closes the selector (OK)
200 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80
210 0xF8 0x14 0x09
300 0xF8 0x14 0x32
500 0xFA 0x00 0x00
510 0xF8 0x00 0x00
1500 0xF8 0xFD 0xED
1600 0xFA 0x00 0x00
1610 0xF8 0x00 0x00
1630 0xFA 0x00 0x00
1640 0xF8 0x00 0x00
2500 0x1C
2510 0x9C
